WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.230
Let's take a look at what you can do
with gestures on your Meta Neural Band.

00:00:02.031 --> 00:00:04.533
To wake or sleep your glasses

00:00:04.533 --> 00:00:07.937
double tap your 
middle finger on your thumb.

00:00:12.241 --> 00:00:13.676
To scroll,

00:00:13.676 --> 00:00:15.044
swipe your thumb on your index finger,

00:00:15.044 --> 00:00:16.846
just like swiping on a phone.

00:00:20.783 --> 00:00:21.917
To select, 

00:00:21.917 --> 00:00:23.686
tap your index finger on your thumb.

00:00:24.153 --> 00:00:27.022
To go back, tap your 
middle finger on your thumb.

00:00:29.058 --> 00:00:29.725
To zoom in

00:00:29.725 --> 00:00:32.695
or out in the Capture,
Photos, and Maps apps,

00:00:32.695 --> 00:00:36.365
you can do an index finger hold and turn
just like turning a knob.

00:00:36.365 --> 00:00:39.502
Index finger hold
and turn your wrist right to zoom in.

00:00:39.502 --> 00:00:42.271
Index finger hold and turn your wrist left

00:00:42.271 --> 00:00:43.772
to zoom out.

00:00:45.574 --> 00:00:46.775
To adjust volume

00:00:46.775 --> 00:00:50.279
index finger hold and turn your wrist
right to increase the volume.

00:00:50.279 --> 00:00:54.216
Index finger hold and turn your wrist 
left to decrease the volume.

00:00:57.086 --> 00:00:59.388
To activate or exit Meta AI,

00:00:59.388 --> 00:01:02.024
double tap your thumb
on the side of your index finger

00:01:03.592 --> 00:01:05.060
While in an app

00:01:05.060 --> 00:01:06.595
to open or close the switcher,

00:01:06.595 --> 00:01:08.397
hold your middle finger to your thumb.

00:01:08.397 --> 00:01:11.467
This is your shortcut
to access the switcher from any app.
